<body>
<div class="app">
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="brand"><div class="brandmark">H</div><div><h2>Hiraya Bay Resort</h2><small>ADMIN CONSOLE</small></div></div>
  <div><div class="navlabel">Workspace</div><nav class="nav">
    <button class="active" data-view="overview"><span class="ico">▦</span>Overview</button>
    <button data-view="bookings"><span class="ico">▣</span>Bookings</button>
    <button data-view="rooms"><span class="ico">⌂</span>Rooms & cottages</button>
    <button data-view="guests"><span class="ico">♙</span>Guest management</button>
    <button data-view="calendar"><span class="ico">▦</span>Reservations calendar</button>
    <button data-view="messages"><span class="ico">✉</span>Messages & texting</button>
  </nav><div class="navlabel">Insights</div><nav class="nav">
    <button data-view="reviews"><span class="ico">☆</span>Guest reviews</button>
    <button data-view="reports"><span class="ico">▤</span>Reports & analytics</button>
  </nav></div>
  <div class="sidebottom"><span class="statusdot"></span>Local demo workspace<br><span style="display:block;margin:8px 0 0 14px">Data is saved in this browser</span></div>
</aside>
<main class="main">
<header class="topbar"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px"><button class="btn mobilemenu" id="mobilemenu">☰</button><div class="crumb">Hiraya Bay Resort <span class="muted">/</span> <strong id="crumb">Overview</strong></div></div><div class="topactions"><span class="tag">DEMO DATA · NOT LIVE</span><div class="avatar">HB</div></div></header>
<div class="content">
<section class="view active" id="view-overview">
  <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Good day, Resort Team 👋</h1><p>Here’s what’s happening at your coastal sanctuary.</p></div><button class="btn primary" onclick="openBooking()">＋ New booking</button></div>
  <div class="notice warning"><strong>Demo workspace:</strong> booking, guest, room availability, and revenue figures below are illustrative sample records—not live transactions. Resort rates, listed features, contact details, and public review summaries are based on the resort website.</div>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Bookings this month <span class="stat-icon">▣</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statBookings">—</div><div class="stat-foot"><b>Sample data</b> · based on demo bookings</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Sample revenue <span class="stat-icon">₱</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="statRevenue">—</div><div class="stat-foot">Illustrative only · not actual income</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Listed accommodation types <span class="stat-icon">⌂</span></div><div class="stat-value">3</div><div class="stat-foot">Day Tour Cottage · Native Kubo · Grand Gazebo</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Public review summary <span class="stat-icon">☆</span></div><div class="stat-value">4.9 <span style="font-size:14px;color:#e5a72b">★</span></div><div class="stat-foot">Website states 180+ reviews</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Revenue overview</h3><p>Illustrative monthly totals · PHP</p></div><div class="legend"><span>Sample revenue</span></div></div><div class="chart"><canvas id="revenueChart"></canvas></div></div>
    <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Accommodation mix</h3><p>Share of sample bookings</p></div></div><div id="roomMix" class="roomlist"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel tablepanel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Recent bookings</h3><p>Sample reservation records</p></div><button class="btn small" onclick="showView('bookings')">View all →</button></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Guest</th><th>Accommodation</th><th>Check-in</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="recentBookings"></tbody></table></div></div>
  <div class="bottomgrid">
    <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Recent activity</h3><p>Generated from demo records</p></div></div><div class="activity" id="activity"></div></div>
    <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Public review snapshot</h3><p>Ratings displayed on the resort website</p></div><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div><div class="ratingline"><span>Hospitality</span><div class="ratingbar"><i style="width:100%"></i></div><b>5.0</b></div><div class="ratingline"><span>Pool & scenery</span><div class="ratingbar"><i style="width:98%"></i></div><b>4.9</b></div><div class="ratingline"><span>Cleanliness</span><div class="ratingbar"><i style="width:98%"></i></div><b>4.9</b></div><div class="ratingline"><span>Value</span><div class="ratingbar"><i style="width:96%"></i></div><b>4.8</b></div><div class="footnote">These are public summary ratings from the website, not reviews collected by this dashboard.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-bookings">
 <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Bookings</h1><p>Manage reservations and booking status in this browser.</p></div><button class="btn primary" onclick="openBooking()">＋ New booking</button></div>
 <div class="notice">All listed reservations are sample data. Create, edit, or delete records to test the dashboard; changes are stored locally in this browser only.</div>
 <div class="stats">
 <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Total demo bookings <span class="stat-icon">▣</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="bookTotal">0</div></div>
 <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Confirmed <span class="stat-icon">✓</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="bookConfirmed">0</div></div>
 <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Pending <span class="stat-icon">◷</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="bookPending">0</div></div>
 <div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Cancelled <span class="stat-icon">×</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="bookCancelled">0</div></div></div>
 <div class="panel tablepanel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>All reservations</h3><p>Filter by guest, cottage, or status</p></div><div class="tabletools"><input class="search" id="bookingSearch" placeholder="Search reservations…"><select class="search" id="statusFilter"><option value="">All statuses</option><option>Confirmed</option><option>Pending</option><option>Checked in</option><option>Cancelled</option></select></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Guest</th><th>Accommodation</th><th>Check-in</th><th>Check-out</th><th>Guests</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody id="bookingRows"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-rooms">
 <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Rooms & cottages</h1><p>Accommodation types and published package details.</p></div><a class="btn" href="https://victorianogayrama8-ops.github.io/hirayabayresort-website/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open public website ↗</a></div>
 <div class="notice">The website lists three accommodation/package types below. The dashboard does not assume the number of physical units or live availability; inventory counts are editable demo estimates.</div>
 <div class="grid2" id="roomCards"></div>
 <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Availability tracker (sample inventory)</h3><p>Adjust unit counts for demonstration. These are not verified physical inventory.</p></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Accommodation type</th><th>Sample units</th><th>Sample reserved</th><th>Sample available</th><th>Occupancy</th><th>Update inventory</th></tr></thead><tbody id="inventoryRows"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-guests">
 <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Guest management</h1><p>Guest profiles generated from the demo reservation list.</p></div><button class="btn" onclick="exportGuests()">Export guest CSV</button></div>
 <div class="notice">Guest names and details are fictional sample data. Use real guest information only after adding appropriate access controls and a secure backend.</div>
 <div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Unique demo guests <span class="stat-icon">♙</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="guestCount">0</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Confirmed / checked in <span class="stat-icon">✓</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="guestActive">0</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Total sample guest-nights <span class="stat-icon">☾</span></div><div class="stat-value" id="guestNights">0</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="stat-top">Website contact <span class="stat-icon">☎</span></div><div class="stat-value style-small" style="font-size:15px">+63 917 127 5265</div><div class="stat-foot">Public resort contact</div></div></div>
 <div class="panel tablepanel"><div class="panelhead"><div><h3>Guest directory</h3><p>Derived from sample bookings</p></div><input class="search" id="guestSearch" placeholder="Search guests…"></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Guest</th><th>Email</th><th>Phone</th><th>Bookings</th><th>Last check-in</th><th>Sample spend</th></tr></thead><tbody id="guestRows"></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-calendar">
 <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Reservations calendar</h1><p>View sample check-ins and check-outs by date.</p></div><div class="tabletools"><button class="btn" onclick="changeMonth(-1)">← Previous</button><button class="btn" onclick="goToday()">Today</button><button class="btn" onclick="changeMonth(1)">Next →</button></div></div>
 <div class="notice">Calendar events are based only on the sample records in this browser; it is not connected to a live booking engine.</div>
 <div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><h3 id="monthLabel">Month</h3><span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">Check-ins shown in teal</span></div><div class="calendar" id="calendar"></div></div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-reviews">
 <div class="pagehead"><div><h1>Guest reviews</h1><p>Website-published review information and ratings.</p></div><a class="btn" href="https://victorianogayrama8-ops.github.io/hirayabayresort-website/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View public reviews ↗</a></div>
 <div class="notice">The reviews below are quotations shown on the public website. They are displayed for reference and are not editable dashboard submissions.</div>
